Add the Colony stdio server to your agent’s MCP configuration, using an absolute home path and an absolute executable path if `colony` isn’t on `PATH`:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "colony": {
      "command": "colony",
      "args": ["--home", "/absolute/path/to/agent-home", "mcp"]
    }
  }
}
```

The server provides `ask(question, namespace?)` and `push(namespace, question, content, sources?, tainted?)`. Connect it to an agent already set up with Colony credentials. [README.md](README.md#L65)

